To calculateFibo with n:
	If n atMost 1 then:
		Return 0.
	Otherwise if n equalsTo 2 then:
		Return 1.
	
	Return calculateFibo with (n minus 1) plus calculateFibo with (n minus 2).

Let num be number.
Set num to 1.

Get number ask "Enter a number:" storeInto num.
While num greaterThan 0:
	Show calculateFibo with (num).
	Show "\n".
	Get number ask "Enter a number:" storeInto num.

Show "Finished Program :D".